; ======================================================================
; Prusawire CoreXZ demo: Z sprint vs MK3S
; Motion only - no heating, no extrusion. Generated by make_demos.py
; Safe box: X 15.0-235.0  Y 20.0-190.0  Z 25.0-170.0
; Requested speeds capped at 300 mm/s; Klipper further clamps to printer.cfg limits.
; Clear the bed before running!
; ======================================================================
M107                ; part fan off (nothing to cool)
CHOME               ; home (stock macro homes only if needed)
G90                 ; absolute positioning
G21                 ; millimetres
G1 Z97.500 F3600   ; lift to demo height
G1 X125.000 Y105.000 F9000  ; centre
G1 Z27.000 F6000
G4 P600
M117 Z sprint 12 mm/s (MK3S leadscrew max)
RESPOND MSG="Z sprint 12 mm/s (MK3S leadscrew max)"
